Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.97,0:00:40.35,Main,Rohan,0,0,0,,{\an8}Arriving late to a meeting is unacceptable, \N as you're clearly well aware...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.32,0:00:40.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,being late for any business\Nmeeting is considered improper.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.12,0:00:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.03,0:00:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an editor arriving six minutes early for a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.14,0:00:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,meeting with his manga\Nartist is equally rude,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.54,0:00:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.40,0:00:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.54,0:00:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arriving early is a bad thing, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.22,0:00:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lucky you're meeting with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.38,0:00:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But on to business.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.48,0:00:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to talk about my upcoming\N61-page one-shot manga, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.40,0:01:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Rohan-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.90,0:01:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're huge friggin' fans!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.08,0:01:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we please get your autograph?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.50,0:01:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you make mine out to my\Npal Akira? Cut it out! Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.18,0:01:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kishibe's not giving autographs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.92,0:01:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you see he's hard at work?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.54,0:01:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't have time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.76,0:01:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's already done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.76,0:01:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unlike some manga artists,\NI'm a fast worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.60,0:01:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always have time to thank my fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two-trip-part autographs done in\Ncoffee?! No way! Thank you, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.78,0:01:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll treasure these!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.12,0:01:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, if you wouldn't mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.92,0:01:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is something personal\NI'd like to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.68,0:01:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before we get down to business.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.34,0:01:37.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.25,0:01:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be perfectly frank,\Nit's a question about cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.80,0:01:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More specifically, my payment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.48,0:01:42.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.84,0:01:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you pay me in advance?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.62,0:01:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've actually just gone bankrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.90,0:01:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.81,0:01:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't gone into debt yet, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.78,0:01:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right now, I'm homeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.30,0:01:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm staying at Koichi's at the moment,\Nbut I don't even have a desk to work on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.66,0:02:02.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Sailor Moon figures, Led Zeppelin\Npaper jacket CDs, Rurouni Kenshin manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.42,0:02:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've sold them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.52,0:02:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slow down a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.80,0:02:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have anywhere to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.72,0:02:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And bankrupt?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.90,0:02:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you just buy yourself an\Nentire mountain the other day,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.74,0:02:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,complete with vacation cottages?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.20,0:02:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you before,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.24,0:02:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bought it to investigate\Nthe rumors of the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.10,0:02:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,monster that lives on\Nthat hill for my manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.40,0:02:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then I heard those developer bastards\Nwanted to build a resort up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.72,0:02:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I bought the six surrounding hills to\Nput a stop to their sleazy little plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.50,0:02:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More land equaled more influence,\Nso what else was I to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.40,0:02:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bought it all to stop the construction.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.24,0:02:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But with plans for the resort\Ncanceled, the land's value plummeted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.88,0:02:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that area's just wilderness\Nin the middle of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.80,0:02:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The six hills I just bought\Nare basically all worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.58,0:02:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means I'm flat broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.52,0:02:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think you could\Noffer me in advance?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.62,0:02:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me process all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.12,0:02:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you really buy all those hills\Nsolely for manga research purposes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.10,0:02:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.01,0:02:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not as an investment?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.93,0:02:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.90,0:02:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm shooting for reality here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.62,0:02:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In your comic about a\Nfolktale monster on a hill?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.22,0:03:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.30,0:03:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imagine if they did build the resort.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.30,0:03:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that traffic could have\Nscared the monster elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.66,0:03:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In which case, my plan\Nwould be for naught.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.46,0:03:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.14,0:03:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with that face?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.44,0:03:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you look me in the eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.88,0:03:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're looking away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.10,0:03:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you think that I've gone\Ncompletely off my rocker, don't you, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.86,0:03:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Editor? Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.72,0:03:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Souped-up supercars and basement video\Ngame theaters are fine and dandy,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.52,0:03:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they're not the only\Nthings manga artists can buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.64,0:03:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.55,0:03:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's more, I did find it in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.32,0:03:35.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you see, my research\Nwas worth every yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.72,0:03:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.98,0:03:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and don't tell anyone outside the\Nmagazine what I'm about to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.34,0:03:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You found it? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.82,0:03:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exactly are you saying you found?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.22,0:03:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.34,0:03:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you not listen to\Npeople when they talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.46,0:03:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw it with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.96,0:03:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The monster of Mutsukabe Hill does exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.30,0:03:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as of this moment,\Nit lives there still.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.84,0:04:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to ask, Rohan-sensei, but\Ncould you please say that again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.32,0:04:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What lives there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.36,0:04:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was a girl named Naoko Osato, a\Nstudent in her last year of college.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.42,0:04:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as September came to a close,\Nshe would murder her boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.18,0:04:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
