Dialogue: 2,0:05:02.69,0:05:08.16,Title,,0,0,0,,{=17}{\an2\blur0.75\fs75\pos(1110,520)}E{\fs60}PISODE{\fs75} ＃02
Dialogue: 2,0:05:02.69,0:05:08.16,Title,,0,0,0,,{=16}{\an2\blur0.75\fnKozuka Mincho Pro Strp B\fs95\pos(1110,620)}“MUTSUKABE HILL”
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.54,0:05:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Naoko Osato,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.12,0:05:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only daughter of the Osato family,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.44,0:05:20.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who found their fortune making Masa in\NMutskabe village for over 300 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.46,0:05:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Osato estate stood at the end\Nof a single track road upon a hill,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.28,0:05:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which is to say, the The\Nentire hill was theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.36,0:05:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, could you go home for the day? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.76,0:05:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And clean up the game stuff, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.12,0:05:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.82,0:05:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone from the main\Nhouse coming to visit?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.32,0:05:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.48,0:05:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can leave through the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.44,0:05:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.84,0:06:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lately, you've been, I don't\Nknow, kind of chilly toward me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.58,0:06:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to ask this,\Nbut is there another guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.10,0:06:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just spared me the\Ntrouble of an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.00,0:06:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm not going to deny that\Nwe've had some good times together,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.84,0:06:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's not going to work out\Nas long as my dad's around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.72,0:06:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a part-time gardener.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.14,0:06:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as my dad's only daughter, I'm\Nsupposed to protect the family fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.96,0:06:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.72,0:06:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I Don't think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.04,0:06:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't mean that come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.28,0:06:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with keeping our thing going?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.78,0:06:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no reason for us to split up
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.62,0:06:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you think they would\Nreact if they came in and saw
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.46,0:06:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,us like this your precious\Nfather in this new man of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.44,0:06:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me fucking go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.92,0:06:49.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.83,0:06:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.98,0:06:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.12,0:06:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.30,0:06:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after you hit me, I just reacted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.00,0:06:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really do love you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.98,0:07:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, even if we have to keep it\Nsecret, I'm happy just the way things...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.96,0:07:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.87,0:07:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here! Please,\Nnow. Listen... Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.00,0:07:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take the damn money and go home already!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.56,0:07:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we didn't exactly tell\Nher we were coming, did we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.24,0:07:17.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll probably be flustered.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.30,0:07:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bet she'll try to do\Nherself up in record time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.44,0:07:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be at the door any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.60,0:07:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gunpei, please take your\Nstuff and get out of here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.56,0:07:32.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be perfectly honest, you're\Nthe one I want to be with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.02,0:07:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this is the man I've been engaged to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.22,0:07:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My family has decided that we'll be\Ngetting married after I graduate college.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.38,0:07:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is the end for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't see each other anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.38,0:07:53.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gunpei?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.94,0:07:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.04,0:08:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.95,0:08:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this is another one of\Nyour jokes, it's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.22,0:08:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another prank, right? Gunpei.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.18,0:08:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop playing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.68,0:08:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't feel a pulse. He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.80,0:08:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.38,0:08:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not knowing what else to do, Naoko Osato\Ndecided to dress Gunpei's wound regardless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.78,0:08:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She pressed a towel she found\Nnearby against his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.78,0:08:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This has to be some kind of trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.14,0:08:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.58,0:08:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just gave him a little push.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.76,0:08:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why was that golf club there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.28,0:08:52.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.50,0:08:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This makes it look like...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.28,0:08:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.24,0:09:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This makes it look like I took the\Ngolf club and beat him to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.26,0:09:01.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gunpei.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.84,0:09:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.28,0:09:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll call a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.44,0:09:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if he's dead already,\NI'll let doctor be any help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.76,0:09:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh god, do I have to\Ncall the cops instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.44,0:09:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Naoko, are you in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.00,0:09:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me, dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.68,0:09:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I brought Shuichi along with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.22,0:09:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's sure excited to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.90,0:09:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.66,0:09:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not anywhere at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.46,0:09:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh. It's locked. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.10,0:09:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe Naoko isn't here after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.66,0:09:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may have been my imagination, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.04,0:09:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Osato, but I could have sworn I saw\Nthat window screen move earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.08,0:10:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to do something with his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.58,0:10:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on he\Ndoesn't have a pulse his
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.18,0:10:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,heart's not beating so\Nwhy is he still bleeding?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.00,0:10:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Naoko, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.14,0:10:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.60,0:10:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.36,0:10:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a spare key.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.86,0:10:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.40,0:10:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, father!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.44,0:10:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.26,0:10:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You caught me tidying up in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.06,0:10:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, so you are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.72,0:10:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess who's here. Shuichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.78,0:10:44.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.74,0:10:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.46,0:10:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you ask him to wait\Nfor me in the main house?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.96,0:10:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Naoko, your voice sounds a little off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.10,0:10:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you alright? Do you\Nneed a hand? No, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.70,0:10:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just changing into something nicer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.42,0:10:58.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So please don't open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.38,0:11:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be with you in a minute, promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.12,0:11:04.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't open that door!
