Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.50,0:11:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.32,0:11:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is it even possible for humans to keep\Nbleeding like this after they're dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.66,0:11:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Naoko, you're using an awful lot of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.30,0:11:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.32,0:11:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me, Shuichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.16,0:11:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you're wondering what\NI'm still doing out front here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.68,0:11:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, it was your father's idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.18,0:11:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He lent me the spare key so you and I\Ncould spend more quality time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.92,0:12:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.52,0:12:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't come in no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.58,0:12:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Naoko, I actually saw someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.28,0:12:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A figure in the window as I\Nwas approaching the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.24,0:12:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looked like someone\Nwas in there with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.42,0:12:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you alone in there right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.14,0:12:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I could have sworn that I saw\None other person in the house with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.06,0:12:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.28,0:12:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.40,0:12:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this is all your fault anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.96,0:12:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.64,0:12:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Naoko, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.24,0:12:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So there is someone else in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.48,0:12:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gunpei, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.10,0:13:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop bleeding, you have to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.88,0:13:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it, I'm coming in right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.44,0:13:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mentioned you saw\Nsomeone else in here with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.68,0:13:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who might that have been, Suichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.10,0:13:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.01,0:13:50.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.28,0:13:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.34,0:13:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unpei... I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:13:58.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.91,0:14:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.88,0:14:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm really sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.30,0:14:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about an overactive imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.86,0:14:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go join your father in the\Nmain house until you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.22,0:14:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so, as arranged,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.52,0:14:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Naoko was married the next spring, and\NShuichi was welcomed into the Osato family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.50,0:14:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But ever since that day, Gunpei Kamafsa\Nhas never once stopped bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.32,0:14:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every day, he quietly\Nbleeds about 300 cc's.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.56,0:14:44.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If his body is not moved, he\Nwill never bleed more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.00,0:14:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, the bleeding is continuous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.04,0:14:53.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Despite the fact that any and all signs\Nof life have completely disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.64,0:15:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Naoko Osato has never once been on a\Ntrip away from home since her marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.10,0:15:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And every morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.98,0:15:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She takes a glass bottle full of Gunpei's\Nblood and discreetly discards it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.24,0:15:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A daily ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.18,0:15:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She does this without fail so as to hide\Nit from the prying eyes of her family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.00,0:15:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Naoko, come and eat with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.90,0:15:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.96,0:15:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since the detached guest house\Nwas demolished for conversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.96,0:15:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hidden in the attic above\Nthe closet in the main house.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.20,0:15:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lies Gunpei.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.22,0:15:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is where Naoko discovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.42,0:15:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That whenever she sprayed\Nwater All over Gunpei's body
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.06,0:15:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow his skin would temporarily return\Nto the state it was in when he was alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.12,0:16:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so cute when you're asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.62,0:16:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gunpei, you are mine and mine alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.18,0:16:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the only person in the whole world who\Ncould take care of you forever and ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.12,0:16:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exactly is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.10,0:16:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no denying he's\Nbeen dead this entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.58,0:16:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I first learned of Gunpei Kamofsa\Non one of my trips to the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.78,0:16:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name arose while I was\Ntalking to some Mutskabe villagers
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.78,0:16:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about their stories and long-held\Nbeliefs in local monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.20,0:16:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you see, Mr. Kishibe,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.32,0:16:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is an absolutely positively fantastic,\Nprofitable, and lucrative deal for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.18,0:16:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.70,0:16:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've told you a hundred times\NI'm not selling my hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.76,0:16:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sure there's some way\Nwe can help change your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.34,0:16:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heh heh heh. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.78,0:16:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.18,0:16:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, hello! This is Matsudera.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.36,0:16:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I learned of this affair when I\Nstumbled into a chance encounter
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.74,0:17:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with Naoko Osato and read her\Nmemory with Heaven's Door.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.42,0:17:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's through this stroke of luck that I\Nlearned about the existence of this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.36,0:17:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.78,0:17:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, can you hear me? The signal's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.24,0:17:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a moment, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.78,0:17:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what are you, huh, Gunpei?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.64,0:17:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I intend to see the truth\Nwith my own two eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.36,0:17:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to know what you're after.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.02,0:17:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the attic above the closet in\Nthat main house, I'll find him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.66,0:17:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Kishibe Rohan, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.70,0:17:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The manga artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.88,0:17:37.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.52,0:17:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd heard you'd been\Nsnooping around here lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.88,0:17:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.74,0:17:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My family always warned me\Nnot to talk to strange men.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.48,0:17:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently there are a lot of perverts\Nand weirdos around these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.08,0:17:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.96,0:18:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.90,0:18:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was all that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.80,0:18:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Running off like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.94,0:18:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.36,0:18:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.18,0:18:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.64,0:18:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's absurd. Ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.74,0:18:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This makes it look like...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.06,0:18:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like I was responsible\Nfor this poor girl's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.30,0:18:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.08,0:18:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is this girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.12,0:18:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.38,0:18:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.52,0:18:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this girl Gunpei's daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.50,0:18:40.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Naoko Osato,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.26,0:18:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did she get pregnant from the corpse\Nhiding in the attic and give birth? Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.72,0:18:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koshime, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.98,0:18:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Mr. Kishibe?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.50,0:18:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.14,0:19:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's trying to possess me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.70,0:19:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heaven's door!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.32,0:19:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.72,0:19:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the memories that make this girl\Nwho she is, they're fading away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.82,0:19:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.96,0:19:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all disappearing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.22,0:19:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If her memories go, I\Ncan't bring her back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.40,0:19:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So before that...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.88,0:19:22.39,Note,Caption,0,0,0,,Note: I know no one named Kishibe Rohan. \NIf we ever crossed paths, I would be unable to see him. {Added a period. -A}{Removed period. BITCH -J} {PUT THE GOD DAMN PERIOD BACK, FOOL! -G}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.96,0:19:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.87,0:19:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.58,0:20:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was too close for comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.24,0:20:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A moment's hesitation, and\NI could have been possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.94,0:20:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or worse yet, devastated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.90,0:20:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a terrifying\Ncreature. Another second.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.92,0:20:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's where you went, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.70,0:20:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kishibe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.61,0:20:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terribly sorry to have\Nleft you alone like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.70,0:20:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was an important call from\Nthe main office, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.90,0:20:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can take your offer and shove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.82,0:20:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.10,0:20:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was the very monster I sought.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.18,0:20:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll call it the Monster\Nof Mutsukabe Hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.06,0:20:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how long\Nthis monster has existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.82,0:20:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.86,0:20:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It preys on love and the\Nhuman heart's weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.06,0:20:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In doing so, it makes\Nhumans do everything for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.24,0:20:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't work, takes no\Nresponsibility, and suffers no hardship.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.16,0:20:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This monster's sole\Npurpose is to reproduce.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.58,0:20:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, perhaps I should call it an organism.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.94,0:21:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The greatest moment of this creature's\Nlife is when it dies in front of someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.18,0:21:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do think that it's possible more of\Nthese creatures are out there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.44,0:21:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They may prolong their existence by\Nfinding a victim to die in front of.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.00,0:21:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that really a true story?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.24,0:21:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a hard pill to swallow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.12,0:21:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, there's no way\Nthat story's a complete lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.32,0:21:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you heard of this monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.04,0:21:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.95,0:21:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do remember a similar creature that\Nmade its home among the Magellanic Clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.60,0:21:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up, you kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.08,0:21:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't just barge into our...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.52,0:21:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, there's something\NI've always wanted to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.40,0:21:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious when\Nyou say you're an alien?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.40,0:21:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.31,0:21:40.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I traveled from the Magellanic\NClouds to live here in Mariah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.74,0:21:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But my spaceship is still standing by...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.24,0:21:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All this alien crap is\Nputting me to sleep here.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.43,0:21:47.07,Main,Okuyasu,0,0,0,,{\an8}Fuckin' annoying space alien...{Ditto. -Starfish}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.60,0:21:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many Mutsukabe Hill\NMonsters walk this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.74,0:21:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no interest in questions like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.60,0:21:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Naoko Osato looks happy enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.88,0:22:00.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I've discovered the monster's purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.86,0:22:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.68,0:22:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's not a scholar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.88,0:22:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or a journalist either.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.42,0:22:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.68,0:22:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just a manga artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.90,0:22:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.78,0:22:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'll marry\Na handsome man one day?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.42,0:22:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.20,0:22:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to know the truth.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.80,0:22:50.14,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I wanna know the truth of life that never ends
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.08,0:22:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of life that never melts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.82,0:22:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To chain a mystic rise.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.14,0:22:55.35,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To unchain the mystic rites I'm calling
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.54,0:22:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.46,0:23:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on my way to find\Neternal valedictives!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.52,0:23:00.81,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I'm on my way to find the eternal verities
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.66,0:23:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exploding all their\Ntears, drops by the sun.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.81,0:23:06.53,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Exploding all the teardrops by the sun
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.28,0:23:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can feel my heart beating,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.53,0:23:11.87,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I can feel my heart beating
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.87,0:23:22.42,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I can see my fate all spinning around beyond the time
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see my faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.10,0:23:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All spinning round beyond our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.72,0:23:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rise up to the sky like a butterfly.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.42,0:23:27.67,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Rise up to the sky, like a butterfly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.28,0:23:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me what's inside your world.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.67,0:23:33.01,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Show me what's inside, don't ever let go
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.74,0:23:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shining stars will guide\Nme to somewhere high.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:33.01,0:23:38.48,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Shining stars will guide me to somewhere high
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.42,0:23:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finding the truth beyond\Nthe heaven's door.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:38.48,0:23:44.36,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Finding the truth beyond the Heaven's Door
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.18,0:23:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.72,0:24:21.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.72,0:24:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.

